WEBVTT

00:09:54.746 --> 00:10:01.162
Googling The Guardian essay that was
written entirely by different GP2 three

00:10:01.412 --> 00:10:02.954
queries and stitched together.

00:10:02.954 --> 00:10:07.787
It's an essay on why artificial
intelligence isn't a threat to humanity.

00:10:07.787 --> 00:10:09.829
And that's impressive.
It's very compelling.

00:10:09.871 --> 00:10:14.871
I actually tried inputting one
of the three online uses.

00:10:15.037 --> 00:10:19.371
I asked the question what is interesting
about some ollman? Oh no.

00:10:20.496 --> 00:10:23.371
Here's what it came back with. It was it
was rather philosophical, actually.

00:10:23.537 --> 00:10:25.954
Came back with. I don't understand
what you mean by interesting.

00:10:26.246 --> 00:10:29.371
It seems to me that this word has
no unambiguous meaning in

00:10:29.371 --> 00:10:33.246
the context of human society beyond its
literal definition as somewhat pleasing